<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Reset your Samaa password</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
      .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0D3B2E 0%, #1A5C47 100%); color: #ffffff; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; }
      .header .brand { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.7; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
      .header p { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.85; }
      .content { padding: 30px; }
      .info-box { background-color: #f0f7f4; border-left: 4px solid #0D3B2E; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .reset-button { display: inline-block; margin: 30px auto; padding: 14px 36px; background-color: #C8960C; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
      .security-box { background-color: #fff8e1; border-left: 4px solid #f0a500; padding: 15px; margin-top: 30px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; color: #7a5400; }
      .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #6c757d; border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef; }
      .footer a { color: #0D3B2E; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="brand">Samaa · سماع</div>
        <h1>Reset your password</h1>
        <p>Secure your Samaa account</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6">
          You requested a password reset for your <strong>Samaa</strong> account.
          Click the button below to set a new password.
        </p>

        <div class="info-box">
          This link is valid for <strong>1 hour</strong>. After that you will need to request a new one.
        </div>

        <div style="text-align: center">
          <a href="<%= RESET_URL %>" class="reset-button">Reset my password</a>
        </div>

        <div class="security-box">
          ⚠️ If you did not request this, you can safely ignore this email.
          Your current password will remain unchanged.
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 15px">
          Jazakum Allahu Khayran,<br />
          <strong>The Samaa Team</strong>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>© <%= YEAR %> Samaa. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This email was sent automatically, please do not reply.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
